# The game's runtime: Winlator (https://github.com/brunodev85/winlator, LGPL-2.1): Wine, Box64, the graphics
# drivers and an X server. The same commit as logie-github/Blizzard and YeaBwoi's Warcraft app.
# scripts/prepare-winlator.sh brings it into this app (app/winlator, git-ignored).
WINLATOR_VERSION=11.2
WINLATOR_APP_REPO=https://github.com/brunodev85/winlator-app
WINLATOR_APP_COMMIT=a030f552f452158a2db64fdb32b490fa19c0b48d
APP_PACKAGE=com.logie.wowforever
# Where Winlator's runtime has its install path compiled in, and where this app puts it: the same length, so the
# rewrite keeps every string and ELF header in place (RootFS.find, patch 0001).
WINLATOR_ROOTFS_PATH=/data/data/com.winlator/files/rootfs
APP_ROOTFS_PATH=/data/data/com.logie.wowforever/wine
